1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:01,700
I coded the most viral Minecraft challenges

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,560
into one mod,

3
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,259
so now you can actually play them.

4
00:00:04,259 --> 00:00:05,400
In Red Light, Green Light,

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,150
one step on red and you're dead.

6
00:00:07,362 --> 00:00:08,302
Dice lets you walk only

7
00:00:08,302 --> 00:00:09,282
as far as you roll.

8
00:00:09,282 --> 00:00:10,762
Every chunk is one random block,

9
00:00:10,762 --> 00:00:12,322
the floor burns if you stand still,

10
00:00:12,322 --> 00:00:13,932
and one zombie becomes ten.

11
00:00:14,117 --> 00:00:15,377
And here's the best part.

12
00:00:15,377 --> 00:00:16,977
Race your friends in Lockout Bingo,

13
00:00:16,977 --> 00:00:17,817
or play against Bob,

14
00:00:17,817 --> 00:00:19,657
an AI I'm teaching to beat you.

15
00:00:19,657 --> 00:00:20,877
Stack challenges for more XP

16
00:00:20,877 --> 00:00:22,947
and unlock all fifty.

17
00:00:22,947 --> 00:00:24,227
It's called Challenge Craft,

18
00:00:24,227 --> 00:00:25,877
and it's free on CurseForge.

19
00:00:26,047 --> 00:00:28,077
So, which challenge should I add next?

